WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
If you've seen these AI characters, you probably noticed something's wrong.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.900
They don't have skin undertones.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.860
Real people have red undertones no matter how dark their pigmentation is.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.760
That's why these AI characters look pitch black or gray,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.220
a lot like some historically racist depictions of black people.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.540
These were some of the 100 accounts we found using AI-generated black women.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.960
Many of the more lifelike-looking characters depict self-hating black women who wish they were white.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:30.480
Other accounts say they only date white men, and others misrepresent real African cultures.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:36.560
Accounts spanned 34 countries across 5 continents and accumulated almost 20 million followers so far

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.960
just in the 100 we sampled. They try to find audiences on social media sites,

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:45.680
then funnel them to sites where they can sell explicit AI media featuring these characters.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.200
But most don't age restrict their content or say that they're AI.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.200
As a result, TikTok banned over half the accounts we reported to them,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.960
but Instagram only took down 2% of the accounts.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.200
They chose to age-gate some more, but come on.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.680
Most of the accounts are very new or just change their usernames to start doing this,

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.680
so this is a new and growing problem.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.520
I suggested some solutions on riddance, or check out the BBC article,

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:14.240
because I want attention so we can start building some momentum towards solving this.
